  "displayName": "Elder Fleet Invasion",
  "subtitle": "Minmatar vs Amarr",
  "description": "The Minmatar Rebellion rises. Strike back against centuries of Amarr oppression, or crush the insurrection and restore divine order. 13 missions across 3 acts.",
